Yes. If **ICPay is ICP-focused**, I would **not design the product around “pairs” as the primary concept**.

The core object should be **ICP assets/tokens**, with ICP as the settlement/base asset.

ICP itself and fungible ICP assets follow the ICRC model; ICRC-1 provides the common token interface, while ICRC-2 adds approvals/transfer-from. ([ICP Developer Docs][1])

