### What I would change in your current UI

Instead of:

> **Markets → pairs**

make it:

> **Markets → tokens/assets**

The left sidebar could become:

```text
MARKETS

Search tokens

All
Trending
New
Gainers
Losers

ICP       $...
ckUSDC    $...
ckETH     $...
DKP       $...
TOKO      $...
